'''Paul''', referred to as a '''Responder corpse''' in-game, is a deceased member of the [[Responders]].

==Background==
[[Maria Chavez]] ordered him to make the monthly scouting trip to [[Vault 76]], in the hopes of contacting them when they opened their doors. She told him to observe the vault for a few days and to not take unnecessary risks.<ref>[[Orders from Maria Chavez]]</ref> Ultimately, he ended up dying outside the vault.

